{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415770","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415770","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1041577001:1":{"text":"哦？又一位伟大的国王陛下，向您致以敬意。","source_cn":"哦？又一位伟大的国王陛下，向您致以敬意。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A8B31832CAD6EA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041577002:1":{"text":"国王陛下？这里哪儿有国王陛下？","source_cn":"国王陛下？这里哪儿有国王陛下？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5833CC237D4B5B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041577003:1":{"text":"早就听闻罗兰大帝是耀光首屈一指的俊美男子，我特此前来，便是想一睹尊容。","source_cn":"早就听闻罗兰大帝是耀光首屈一指的俊美男子，我特此前来，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85DE52E3437FBC62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041577004:1":{"text":"原来比起俊美的容颜，您更喜欢以这副狡黠的模样示人吗？","source_cn":"原来比起俊美的容颜，您更喜欢以这副狡黠的模样示人吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE85BF3A33C83D0D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041577005:1":{"text":"哎呀呀，你要这样说，我倒不好意思敷衍你了。","source_cn":"哎呀呀，你要这样说，我倒不好意思敷衍你了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x77A916DE48025EFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document